{
  "schema": "dogg/0-missions",
  "_comment": [
    "Mission schemas: which numbers of a dimension's frame ride INSIDE a 12-word mission chant.",
    "Each field is LOG-quantized to 14 bits (1 \u2026 1e15 at ~0.21% relative precision) \u2014 one encoding for every magnitude.",
    "A dimension without a schema still gets a mission chant carrying tick + frame-hash prefix only.",
    "The first three fields are what a MISSION chant carries; a LENS chant may select any of them by mask."
